WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
[Music and cart wheels] Sylwen follows a cart
loaded with blue salt in a Steam match with bots.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.800
Sylwen fires down the track.
An opposing fighter closes in.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.550
[Scripted development footage]
Vessa rolls a keg. It bursts in a flash of fire.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.800
Drums build as the cart enters the lift.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.000
[Delivery chime] Blue crystals flare.
Join the free Windows Playtest on Steam.
